   "updated": 1763726400000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Patient search (ADR-008)\nsources/profile.py — a trial's profile, read\nat every transfer (who can join, where it\nrecruits, conditions, MedDRA, products)\nsearch/index.py — the trial's document for\nsearch, built in the transfer; concepts.py\nquery.py — rules + gazetteer read a query\n(no model); categories.json · lexicon.json\nannotate.py — AI tags, quotes checked\n(job annotate, in the weekly refresh)\ngeo/ — GeoNames load, sites geocoded\nvocab/ — MeSH load\nweb/search.py + privacy.py — /find\ncommands: source profiles · geo load ·\ngeo geocode · geo find · vocab load ·\nsearch reindex · search annotate ·\nsearch eval (evals/search-queries.json)",
   "originalText": "Patient search (ADR-008)\nsources/profile.py — a trial's profile, read\nat every transfer (who can join, where it\nrecruits, conditions, MedDRA, products)\nsearch/index.py — the trial's document for\nsearch, built in the transfer; concepts.py\nquery.py — rules + gazetteer read a query\n(no model); categories.json · lexicon.json\nannotate.py — AI tags, quotes checked\n(job annotate, in the weekly refresh)\ngeo/ — GeoNames load, sites geocoded\nvocab/ — MeSH load\nweb/search.py + privacy.py — /find\ncommands: source profiles · geo load ·\ngeo geocode · geo find · vocab load ·\nsearch reindex · search annotate ·\nsearch eval (evals/search-queries.json)",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 6,
   "textAlign": "center",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
   "containerId": "search",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
